{"excerpt_id":"ex_967446798047_050","source_id":"src_967446798047","source_hash":"b78a6caf5cd728ae7233d1bebd384538f37e3fac96a355829cf50ffab6c2f12f","text":"from server import PromptServer\nfrom aiohttp import web\nroutes = PromptServer.instance.routes\n@routes.post ( &#x27;/my_new_path&#x27; )\nasync def my_function ( request ):\nthe_data = await request.post()\n# the_data now holds a dictionary of the values sent\nMyClass.handle_my_message(the_data)\nreturn web.json_response({})","location_hint":"paragraph 126","char_start":4794,"char_end":5114,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:44:48.660Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_967446798047_051","source_id":"src_967446798047","source_hash":"b78a6caf5cd728ae7233d1bebd384538f37e3fac96a355829cf50ffab6c2f12f","text":"Unless you know what you are doing, don’t try to define my_function within a class.\nThe @routes.post decorator does a lot of work! Instead, define the function as above\nand then call a classmethod.","location_hint":"paragraph 127","char_start":5119,"char_end":5316,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:44:48.660Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_967446798047_052","source_id":"src_967446798047","source_hash":"b78a6caf5cd728ae7233d1bebd384538f37e3fac96a355829cf50ffab6c2f12f","text":"You can also define a @routes.get if you aren’t changing anything.","location_hint":"paragraph 128","char_start":5320,"char_end":5386,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:44:48.660Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_967446798047_053","source_id":"src_967446798047","source_hash":"b78a6caf5cd728ae7233d1bebd384538f37e3fac96a355829cf50ffab6c2f12f","text":"The client can use this new route by sending a FormData object with code something like this,\nwhich would result in the_data , in the above code, containing message and node_id keys:","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":5388,"char_end":5570,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:44:48.660Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_967446798047_054","source_id":"src_967446798047","source_hash":"b78a6caf5cd728ae7233d1bebd384538f37e3fac96a355829cf50ffab6c2f12f","text":"import { api } from \"../../scripts/api.js\" ;\nfunction send_message ( node_id , message ) {\nconst body = new FormData ();\nbody . append ( &#x27;message&#x27; , message );\nbody . append ( &#x27;node_id&#x27; , node_id );\napi . fetchApi ( \"/my_new_path\" , { method: \"POST\" , body , });\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 130","char_start":5574,"char_end":5858,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:44:48.660Z"}
